Description: PEM Encoding (RFC 7468) for PKIX, PKCS, and CMS Structures, implementing a strict subset of the original Privacy-Enhanced Mail encoding intended specifically for use with cryptographic keys, certificates, and other messages - Rust source code
 Provides a no_std-friendly, constant-time implementation suitable for use with
 cryptographic private keys.
